{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/logo-about.png?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/1.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/2.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/7.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/vehicles.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real spherical mini planets arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast runs (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of weapons and powerups to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to get items from the shop between waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty levels so everybody can enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3368550?t=1750962154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750962154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/f6dd820554634ca776384b5ce55acf8df4979f88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750962154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/f6dd820554634ca776384b5ce55acf8df4979f88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750962154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3830010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/logo-about.png?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/1.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/2.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/7.gif?t=1750962154\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_para